1; label=library-new-request; body_chars=39\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"existing_tests\",\n        \"summary\": \"0 existing test file path(s) included\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"input_tokens_used\": 32,\n    \"issue_label\": \"library-new-request\",\n    \"issue_number\": 9730,\n    \"library\": \"org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1\",\n    \"model\": \"sonnet\",\n    \"output_tokens_used\": 14707,\n    \"risks\": [\n      \"This is the first 'real' artifact in the spring-boot-*-test family to be onboarded here \\u2014 its sibling POM-only starters (e.g. spring-boot-starter-micrometer-metrics-test) are already marked not-for-native-image with this artifact as the replacement, but there's no prior PR in this repo for a sibling like spring-boot-webmvc-test/spring-boot-restclient-test to cross-check the exact test shape against.\"\n    ],\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"summary\": \"Pure test-support SPI module (one annotation + one ContextCustomizerFactory, registered via bundled META-INF/spring.factories). All classes it activates (MetricsAutoConfiguration, SimpleMetricsExportAutoConfiguration, CompositeMeterRegistryAutoConfiguration, ObservationAutoConfiguration) are already transitive compile dependencies via spring-boot-micrometer-metrics and spring-boot-micrometer-observation, declared on this artifact's own POM alongside spring-boot-test-autoconfigure and micrometer-observation-test. No Docker, external service, or environment/system property is required \\u2014 it's an in-process Spring test-context customizer with zero network or native-OS surface.\"\n  },\n  \"libraryUpdateRoute\": null,\n  \"newVersion\": null,\n  \"phases\": {\n    \"explore\": {\n      \"chunkClassCount\": null,\n      \"chunkProcessedClassCount\": 0,\n      \"exhaustedClasses\": [],\n      \"iteration\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"running\"\n    },\n    \"finalization\": {\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\n    },\n    \"fix\": {\n      \"iter